# Check every text file out with LF line endings on every platform, so a Windows working tree reads byte for byte
# what CI reads. Git for Windows otherwise converts to CRLF on checkout (core.autocrlf), and the build's checks
# parse source with patterns written for LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Committed with CRLF and kept as written: a Windows batch file, and research records whose bytes are the record.
*.cmd -text
docs/research/2026-10-30-the-system/*.svg -text
docs/research/minus-world/*.csv -text
